Complete worked answers are available in https://www.maths.ox.ac.uk/system/files/attachments/groupsandreprsexam2015_solutions.pdf[Oxford's solution notes]. The https://www.maths.ox.ac.uk/members/students/undergraduate-courses/mmathphys-past-paper-solutions-0[official answer index] explicitly pairs those notes with the 2015–16 paper; the filename uses the earlier year, while this exam follows its printed cover. The reproduced questions match the held paper, so new solutions are skipped.
